      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHINY INTENTION (1) was well supported last time and rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but had to settle for the minor money, finishing a one length second (24.15) over 407m at this track. Can go on with it. CANGRANDE (6) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (24.28) at this track behind Velocity Miranda in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Speedy beginner who can find the front despite the tricky draw. Can measure up. MATILDA HAYZE (8) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 407m behind Emergency Man (24.71) in a Grade 6. Was a winner the start prior. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MAY MOO MOO (2) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
